  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Solidarity Forever** (1 other source): John played a solo stretch of the set that included this song, and seemed to be enjoying himself [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **In the Cane Fields**: back after 283 archived shows (9910 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Solidarity Forever**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Dark as a Dungeon**: back after 35 archived shows (630 days); rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Palisades Park**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Enoch 18:14**: back after 24 archived shows (464 days) [3]\n- **An Antidote for Strychnine**: rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **Song for Dennis Brown**: back after 36 archived shows (640 days) [3]\n- **Going Invisible 2**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2019-09-05.AUD** (recommended): audience recording; 26 songs; 127 min [1]\n- **tmg2019-09-05.soloset**: source not stated; 4 songs; 14 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2019-09-05.AUD**: taped by tungol; transferred by roffels; source: AUD [1]. Also: Recorded with a TASCAM DR-40 in dual mode, backup at -10db; processed with Izotope and Audacity, then converted to 16-bit FLAC [1]",
